  "text": "AFK Ivar, King of Bones\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nPositioning\n\n⬥ Upon entering the arena  and walk 1 tile north\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If the kill takes too long you will be moved\n​\nMelee AFK Method (76+ kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nItems\n⬥ Am-hej \n⬥ Masterwork 2h sword \n    • May replace with  and  at the cost of kph\n⬥ Vestments of havoc armour \n⬥ Scripture of Ful \n⬥ Igneous Kal-Ket  or Igneous Kal-Zuk \nAbilities\n⬥ Chaos Roar \n    • Expect less kph if not using\nOther\n⬥ Holy scarab \n    • May not be needed depending on setup\n⬥ Pray Divine Rage , Piety , Rapid Restore \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPreset Suggestions\n⬥ Melee \n\n​\nAction Bars\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Melee \n​\nMagic AFK Method (74+ kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nItems\n⬥ Dragon Rider Amulet  or Amulet of Souls \n⬥ Roar of Awakening  and Ode to Deceit \n    • Perked with Lunging Perk \n⬥ Scripture of Amascut \n⬥ Igneous Kal-Mej  or Igneous Kal-Zuk \nOther\n⬥ Pray Affliction \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPreset Suggestions\n⬥ Magic \n\n​\nAction Bars\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Magic \n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Ivar, King of Bones ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Positioning ⬥ Upon entering the arena and walk 1 tile north ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If the kill takes too long you will be moved ​ Melee AFK Method (76+ kph) Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Items ⬥ Am-hej ⬥ Masterwork 2h sword • May replace with and at the cost of kph ⬥ Vestments of havoc armour ⬥ Scripture of Ful ⬥ Igneous Kal-Ket or Igneous Kal-Zuk Abilities ⬥ Chaos Roar • Expect less kph if not using Other ⬥ Holy scarab • May not be needed depending on setup ⬥ Pray Divine Rage , Piety , Rapid Restore Preset Suggestions ⬥ Melee ​ Action Bars ​ Example Kills ⬥ Melee ​ Magic AFK Method (74+ kph) Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Items ⬥ Dragon Rider Amulet or Amulet of Souls ⬥ Roar of Awakening and Ode to Deceit • Perked with Lunging Perk ⬥ Scripture of Amascut ⬥ Igneous Kal-Mej or Igneous Kal-Zuk Other ⬥ Pray Affliction ​ Preset Suggestions ⬥ Magic ​ Action Bars ​ Example Kills ⬥ Magic ​",
